      "heading": "Additional district judgeships for the districts of Colorado and Idaho",
      "source_id": "HB6FBEC3BB6E042D18781B6078FB7A358",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": 2,
          "anchor": "s2-l2",
          "depth": 0,
          "text": "(a) Colorado The President shall appoint, by and with the advice and consent of the Senate, 2 additional district judges for the district of Colorado.",
          "source_id": "HFC1E420DE3FB49A59AAA2220108CE2B6",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "n": 3,
          "anchor": "s2-l3",
          "depth": 0,
          "text": "(b) Idaho The President shall appoint, by and with the advice and consent of the Senate, 1 additional district judges for the district of Idaho.",
